sweet sample: a sample on request over USB, and samples for as long as the phone runs (0225).

all-21 (2026-11-18): after 117 minutes the picture froze (Safari, YouTube) while the kernel went on (thermal, touch,
modem and USB lines to the end); backboardd drew its last frame at about 7010 s. The sampler that says where SpringBoard
and backboardd are had printed its 40th and last sample 37 minutes earlier, and the phone was on the cable with the
command server answering. Now: after the 40 samples at 120 s, one every 300 s without end; and the command
"sample" (or "sample name,name") on UDP 5141 prints one at once (SMP lines, as before).
Not run on hardware yet.

